# --- Downloaded model weights -------------------------------------------
# faster-whisper checkpoints fetched from HuggingFace for the Task 7
# benchmark. ~216MB, and whisper-base/model.bin (138MB) exceeds GitHub's
# hard 100MB file limit outright. These are third-party artifacts, not our
# work product: re-fetch with the curl commands in docs/RUNNING_NOTES.md, or
# let faster-whisper pull them into ~/.cache/huggingface on first use.
c1/models/whisper-*/

# NOTE: c1/models/lid_latin.ftz is deliberately NOT ignored. It is our own
# trained fastText LID classifier (1.3MB), it is the Task 3 deliverable, and
# keeping it tracked means lid_hybrid.py works on a fresh clone without a
# training step.

# --- Generated audio -----------------------------------------------------
# Task 6 SNR tiers and reverb condition, ~119MB. Fully regenerable and
# deterministic: `python3 c1/scripts/make_noisy_variants.py` reproduces them
# bit-for-bit from the seed recorded in results/c1_noise_manifest.json.
c1/predictions/noisy_audio/

# --- Python ---------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# --- Editor / OS ----------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
*.swp
